abstract: A deterministic, point-weighted benchmark toolkit for Chinese Gaokao questions. Engine 0.1.8 separates a subject-neutral harness from versioned benchmark specifications and immutable data packages, with one scoped primary metric, explicit primary/catalog task-type eligibility, closed full-paper coverage metadata, provider-pinned reproducibility controls, resume support, diagnostic text/vision slices, compact terminal reports, and explicit per-question answer-format instructions. The 0.0.4 dataset remains immutable for citation; newer specifications can report a full-credit diagnostic without introducing a second primary score. The complete dataset package is licensed under CC BY 4.0; the harness and code remain Apache-2.0.

